                        "glosses": [
                            "An ancient Carthaginian or Greek galley having three banks of oars, rowed by five oarsmen: two to an oar in each of the upper rows, and one to the lower oar."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
