                                "sense_id": "9f23da52-b270-3947-82db-4ecaabb7ad52",
                                "text": "Quinquireme of Nineveh from distant Ophir / Rowing home to haven in sunny Palestine / With a cargo of ivory, / And apes and peacocks, / Sandalwood, cedarwood, and sweet white wine."
                            }
                        ]
